<span class="Normal1"><font size="1" face="Arial">
<a href="20240119-11.pdf" style="text-decoration: none">––&nbsp; Anayasa Mahkemesinin 
30/11/2023 Tarihli ve E: 2023/102, K: 2023/203 Sayılı Kararı</a></font></span></p>
